'''Scorpius''' is a mayoral candidate that can be elected during the [[Mayor Election]] event. His perks focus around the [[Dark Auction]]. He is one of the five special candidates to run for election.

== Mayoral Perks ==
{{MayorPerks|Scorpius}}

=== Bribe ===
If '''Scorpius''' wins and the user voted for him, the user will be eligible to claim the bribe reward by speaking to '''Scorpius''' while elected. He will reward the user coins, based on the amount of playtime they have on their current profile when they redeem the bribe. For example, if the user voted for '''Scorpius''' with 295 hours of playtime at the time of voting, but 305 hours at the time of claiming the bribe, they will receive {{c|1,000,000}}, not {{c|500,000}}.<ref>https://hypixel.net/threads/help-needed-regarding-scorpius-bribe-amounts-and-playtime.3905609/</ref><ref>https://www.reddit.com/r/HypixelSkyblock/comments/lmmitk/help_needed_regarding_scorpius_bribe_amounts_and/</ref><ref>https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1zG2_Qe7clLBIjaxF5q9TTRxLTQZPlv_tHcq27os6SG0/edit?usp=sharing</ref> 
