=== Darker Auctions ===
{{Main|Darker Auctions}}

When [[Scorpius]] is elected mayor and his {{AN|Darker Auctions}} perk is available, there will be {{Green|8}} items auctioned instead of {{Green|5}}. The auctioned items will be randomly selected from the possible items available from that round.

Each item may only appear once: items that appear cannot appear in any following rounds.
